From df589bcde0f3626a58236acfef959031d6ddc1af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 07:12:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Restyle the site in charcoal and steel blue

Move away from the navy and red look to a serious, educational
humanitarian style. The logo keeps its own colours.

- Charcoal headings and dark panels, steel blue as the one accent,
  white pages with cool gray sections; form errors in a true red
- Inter for headlines as well as text (no serif); Archivo removed
- Small 4 px corners on buttons and tags, 6 px on cards
- Session dates read "Sat, Nov 14" on the home cards and phones, and
  "Nov / 14 / Sat" on the ticket tiles, in plain capitals
- Session titles use the headline style on every page
- Developer notes and the assets readme describe the new look

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XvEVSd1jgW3w27ndoppwzE
