 /* ============================================================
    YOUNG MEDICAL ENGINEERS · shared stylesheet
-   Warm, people-first nonprofit design. Brand hues were
-   sharpened in September 2026 and the logo files recolored to
-   match: ink navy, true red, cool steel, charcoal.
-   Company colours: navy #1B365D, red #C8102E, white #FFFFFF, blue-gray #EAF0F7.
-   Pages are white, with blue-gray sections; navy and red carry the brand.
-   Type: self-hosted in assets/fonts (SIL OFL). Archivo, a free
-   stand-in for Univers, for headlines, labels and numbers (the Free.
-   Always. band, impact figures); Inter for body text and UI. The site
-   uses no serif typeface.
+   Serious, educational, humanitarian. Charcoal carries the brand,
+   steel blue is the one accent (buttons, links, small labels),
+   and pages are white with cool gray sections. Small 4 px corners.
+   Site colours: charcoal #1F2A33, slate #2E3A44, steel blue #3F5F7F,
+   white #FFFFFF, cool gray #F1F3F5. The logo keeps its own colours
+   (navy, red, steel and charcoal); do not recolour it to match.
+   Type: Inter everywhere, a plain sans like Arial, self-hosted in
+   assets/fonts (SIL OFL). No serif typeface.
    ============================================================ */
 
 /* ---- fonts (self-hosted, latin, variable weight) ------------------- */
 @font-face{ font-family:"Inter"; src:url("fonts/inter.woff2") format("woff2"); font-weight:400 700; font-style:normal; font-display:swap; }
-@font-face{ font-family:"Archivo"; src:url("fonts/archivo.woff2") format("woff2"); font-weight:100 900; font-stretch:62% 125%; font-style:normal; font-display:swap; }
 
 :root{
   color-scheme: light;
 
-  /* brand palette (matches the recolored logo files) */
